  <p>School quality is often the top priority for military families relocating with children. San Antonio offers several excellent school districts.</p>

  <h3>Schertz-Cibolo-Universal City ISD</h3>
  <p>Consistently rated as one of Texas's best districts with strong military family presence, excellent schools, and comprehensive support services.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Rating: Highly rated</li>
    <li>Communities: Schertz, Cibolo, Universal City</li>
    <li>Military Family Support: Excellent</li>
    <li>Test Scores: Above average</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>North East ISD</h3>
  <p>Serves East San Antonio with top-rated schools, strong academics, and excellent programs for military families.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Rating: Top-rated</li>
    <li>Communities: Live Oak, surrounding areas</li>
    <li>Programs: Comprehensive</li>
    <li>Test Scores: Excellent</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>San Antonio ISD</h3>
  <p>The largest district with diverse schools serving urban and suburban San Antonio with military family programs.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Rating: Varies by school</li>
    <li>Coverage: Citywide</li>
    <li>Diversity: High</li>
    <li>Options: Magnet programs available</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Finding Your Perfect School</h2>
